      "text": "A coordinated effort led to the capture of a fugitive. \n #BorderPatrol agents, working alongside the #FBI, arrested a fugitive illegal alien wanted in Mexico for kidnapping, who had been hiding out in San Bernardino. His visa expired in 1998—but justice doesn't expire.\n The #PremierSector coordinated with Mexican authorities and removed him to Mexico to face justice.\n #CBP #DHS",
